{"id":"9e70b896da231f4f","group":"58","path":"58/batch19/58-df-well-founded.md","title":"Well-Founded Relation","display":"df-well-founded — Well-Founded Relation","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-well-founded","aliases":["58-df-well-founded","Well-Founded","Foundation"],"display":"df-well-founded — Well-Founded Relation","depends_on":["[[58-df-relation]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-well-founded"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-well-founded</span><span>Well-Founded</span><span>Foundation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-well-founded — Well-Founded Relation"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"7ccfc8c88f29968a\" href=\"?note=7ccfc8c88f29968a\" title=\"58-df-relation\">58-df-relation</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Explicit relation signatures used below: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{WF}\\subseteq V^{2}\">\\(\\mathrm{WF}\\subseteq V^{2}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{WellFounded}_S\\subseteq V^{2}\">\\(\\mathrm{WellFounded}_S\\subseteq V^{2}\\)</span>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,R\\in V\">\\(X,R\\in V\\)</span> with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\subseteq X\\times X\">\\(R\\subseteq X\\times X\\)</span> (carrier and binary relation)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{WellFounded}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{WellFounded}_S\\)</span> and the established two-place <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{WF}\">\\(\\mathrm{WF}\\)</span> notation (explicit predicates)</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}well\\text{-}founded\\text{-}explicit}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{WellFounded}_S(R,X)\\leftrightarrow\nR\\subseteq X\\times X\\land\\forall Y\\subseteq X\\;\\bigl(Y\\neq\\varnothing\\to\\exists y\\in Y\\;\\forall x\\in Y\\;\\neg(xRy)\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}well\\text{-}founded\\text{-}explicit}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{WellFounded}_S(R,X)\\leftrightarrow\nR\\subseteq X\\times X\\land\\forall Y\\subseteq X\\;\\bigl(Y\\neq\\varnothing\\to\\exists y\\in Y\\;\\forall x\\in Y\\;\\neg(xRy)\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}well\\text{-}founded\\text{-}alias}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{WF}(R,X)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{WellFounded}_S(R,X)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}well\\text{-}founded\\text{-}alias}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{WF}(R,X)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{WellFounded}_S(R,X)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Well-foundedness always carries its domain explicitly; the alias now agrees with the established two-place <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{WF}(R,X)\">\\(\\mathrm{WF}(R,X)\\)</span> signature used by Mostowski collapse and iteration atoms.</li>\n<li>In ZFC this is equivalent to the absence of an infinite descending <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span>-sequence; that equivalence uses dependent choice and is therefore recorded as a theorem rather than a second definition.</li>\n<li>Transfinite recursion: defines function on well-founded set</li>\n<li>Mostowski collapse: unique transitive isomorphic image</li>\n<li>Induction principle: prove property by showing all predecessors have it</li>\n<li>Accessibility: well-founded relation is accessible from any starting point</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Jech, Set Theory, Chapter 6</li>\n<li>Kunen, Set Theory, Chapter I</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-relation","status":"resolved","id":"7ccfc8c88f29968a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-relation]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{WF}\\subseteq V^{2}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{WellFounded}_S\\subseteq V^{2}","display":false},{"tex":"X,R\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"R\\subseteq X\\times X","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{WellFounded}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{WF}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}well\\text{-}founded\\text{-}explicit}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{WellFounded}_S(R,X)\\leftrightarrow\nR\\subseteq X\\times X\\land\\forall Y\\subseteq X\\;\\bigl(Y\\neq\\varnothing\\to\\exists y\\in Y\\;\\forall x\\in Y\\;\\neg(xRy)\\bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}well\\text{-}founded\\text{-}alias}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{WF}(R,X)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{WellFounded}_S(R,X)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{WF}(R,X)","display":false},{"tex":"R","display":false}],"bytes":1705,"backlinks":[{"id":"44bdd9fc7474825c","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"2eaad590ac255c04","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{WF}$ (two-place well-founded-relation predicate, see [[../batch19/58-df-well-founded.md]])"},{"id":"0bde46949efca63c","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"8a909a60ed22217b","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{WellFounded}_S\\subseteq V^2$ (see [[58-df-well-founded]])"},{"id":"99d86fa29fbc789f","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{WellFounded}_S$ (well-foundedness predicate, see [[../batch19/58-df-well-founded.md]])"},{"id":"0134626c9734e3cd","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{WF}$ (well-founded-relation predicate, see [[../batch19/58-df-well-founded.md]])"},{"id":"f24a90d5cfa36cd1","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{WF}$ (well-founded-relation predicate, see [[../batch19/58-df-well-founded.md]])"},{"id":"909c5efc04dca7f4","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"1273aebf17781a00","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$R\\subseteq X\\times X$ (binary relation, see [[../batch19/58-df-well-founded]])"},{"id":"e406e8afb48a5978","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{WF}$ (良基关系谓词, see [[../batch19/58-df-well-founded.md]])"},{"id":"b244db7d9d164dbe","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{WellFounded}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[58-df-well-founded]])"},{"id":"407758cb4b596714","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"a11585cba9c21cfd","anchor":"ref-91","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[58-df-well-founded]]"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1387","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-df-well-founded.md|58-df-well-founded]]（batch19）"}],"outgoing":["7ccfc8c88f29968a"]}